Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://automataia.github.io/debian-package-repository/

Package: automata-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Priority: important
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, apt
Description: APT repository key and sources for packages.automataIA
 Installs the OpenPGP public key of the automataIA APT repository into
 /usr/share/keyrings/ and pins it via a Deb822 sources file with
 Signed-By, configuring apt to fetch packages from the repository's
 GitHub Pages endpoint.
